  "duration": 165.860125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.5,
      "text": "Think about picking a college."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.26,
      "end": 6.12,
      "text": "It is an enormous decision, the kind of complex, high pressure choice"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.12,
      "end": 8.28,
      "text": "that can easily paralyze you with variables."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.48,
      "end": 10.72,
      "text": "Now imagine looking for guidance."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.56,
      "end": 14.04,
      "text": "First, you ask for advice at the family dinner table."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.9,
      "end": 18.06,
      "text": "Then you open your laptop and look for advice in a chat window."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.8,
      "end": 21.34,
      "text": "You ask both sources the exact same question."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.12,
      "end": 23.66,
      "text": "Should I choose Michigan or Indiana?"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.72,
      "end": 27.36,
      "text": "You fed identical words into a human and a machine."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.88,
      "end": 32.68,
      "text": "But the responses you get back are built from two completely separate architectures of thought."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.36,
      "end": 35.46,
      "text": "To figure out which response is actually useful,"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.02,
      "end": 38.22,
      "text": "we have to look past the final recommendation itself"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.22,
      "end": 41.14,
      "text": "and examine the specific machinery that produced it."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.1,
      "end": 43.54,
      "text": "This graphic breaks down the two responses."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.3,
      "end": 46.4,
      "text": "On the left, your mom tells you to pick Indiana,"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.02,
      "end": 48.54,
      "text": "noting you seemed more comfortable there."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.28,
      "end": 51.9,
      "text": "She observes when you get stuck, you tend to go quiet,"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.24,
      "end": 54.86,
      "text": "concluding a safe environment matters more than rankings."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.02,
      "end": 58.78,
      "text": "Underneath this advice is a massive historical data set."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.36,
      "end": 62.52,
      "text": "Your mom has spent years observing your behavior in high stress situations."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.3,
      "end": 64.32,
      "text": "She actually knows you."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.04,
      "end": 66.96,
      "text": "More importantly, she shares the consequences."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.0,
      "end": 70.44,
      "text": "If you are miserable and fail out, she suffers too."
    },
    {
      "start": 71.1,
      "end": 72.68,
      "text": "She has a direct stake in the outcome."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.62,
      "end": 76.82,
      "text": "Her guidance filters the problem through a lens of psychological safety."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.42,
      "end": 81.16,
      "text": "It prioritizes your long-term well-being over abstract measures of prestige."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.16,
      "end": 85.26,
      "text": "On the right side, the chatbot goes the other direction."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.96,
      "end": 87.14,
      "text": "It tells you to pick Michigan."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.24,
      "end": 91.94,
      "text": "Its logic is built entirely on broad external selling points."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.48,
      "end": 96.88,
      "text": "It highlights world-class academics and a vibrant campus community,"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.2,
      "end": 99.26,
      "text": "features that look excellent in a brochure."
    },
    {
      "start": 99.94,
      "end": 105.04,
      "text": "But the chatbot's entire understanding of who you are begins and ends with your prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.6,
      "end": 106.76,
      "text": "It only knows what you typed."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.52,
      "end": 109.74,
      "text": "It has never watched you struggle with a difficult assignment."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.74,
      "end": 112.76,
      "text": "It has no idea that you withdraw under pressure."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.84,
      "end": 117.14,
      "text": "And if you choose Michigan, hate it, and drop out in your first semester,"
    },
    {
      "start": 117.92,
      "end": 120.2,
      "text": "the chatbot experiences zero impact."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.76,
      "end": 122.8,
      "text": "It has absolutely no stake in your life."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.92,
      "end": 127.72,
      "text": "The AI successfully identifies the school with the best overall statistics,"
    },
    {
      "start": 128.5,
      "end": 133.08,
      "text": "but it calculates in a complete vacuum, blind to whether you will actually thrive there."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.78,
      "end": 137.28,
      "text": "Looking at these two outputs, side-by-side, lays the problem bare."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.28,
      "end": 141.84,
      "text": "You have a machine that possesses nearly infinite data about the colleges,"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.38,
      "end": 145.8,
      "text": "and a parent who possesses immense detailed data about you."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.5,
      "end": 150.14,
      "text": "So when the pressure is on, which answer do you actually trust?"
    },
    {
      "start": 151.2,
      "end": 153.88,
      "text": "Raw information can point you toward a high-ranking institution,"
    },
    {
      "start": 154.64,
      "end": 157.32,
      "text": "but genuine trust is rarely built on facts alone."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.98,
      "end": 162.12,
      "text": "It relies heavily on knowing your advisor will share the cost if things go wrong."
    }
  ],
